TxBridge is an independent program. It speaks the serial protocol of FS-CT6A/B class
transmitters, which was worked out by analysing how the "Digital Radio" demo build
exchanges data with the radio (offsets, enumerations, ranges). No source code, UI
assets, licence logic or registered-version content from that program is used.
The ".cfg" file format is the one used by the t6config family of tools.
